// B08 — Operator Hamiltonians and Suzuki evolution (minimal dialect face).
// WP-0089 / LISS-0290: ADR 0180 ty-fill; LISS-0305 multi-bind (ADR 0184).
// Leftover leaves via tracing_out (ADR 0173).

// ADR 0195: J/h carry real Energy units (bare multi-bind can't attach a
// unit); H_chain stays inferred (ADR 0180 ty-fill still applies).
Energy J = 1.0.eV to J
Energy h = 0.5.eV to J

H_chain = -J * (Z[0] * Z[1]) - h * (X[0] + X[1])

// LISS-0309: multi-ket multi-bind (ideal dialect face).
s0, s1 = |+>, |+>
Time dur = 0.7.fs
State (s0, s1) = Evolve { (s0, s1) under H_chain for dur using Suzuki(order = 2, steps = 6) }.run()

State zz = expect(ZZ, s0, s1)
Measure s0 tracing_out s1
